  "question": "Does the anonymous NLC Wenjin detail page for the 2004 《文汇报》 13-DVD item emit a concrete item-specific content URI or directLink that can be inspected without login, SSO, VPN or document-delivery submission?",
  "answer": "No. The anonymous item page directly emits uri='' and directLink='', isUserLogin=false, isInnerIP='false', isVpnLink='false', isTsingHuaTongFang='false' and isSamlLink='false'. It emits only the generic VPN prefix https://vpn2.nlc.cn/prx/000/http/, which is not an item-specific content URI. No readingurl attribute is emitted, loginLink hrefSrc is empty, and the page explicitly states that online reading cannot be used while not logged in. Therefore the current anonymous Wenjin item surface exposes no direct content object for the 1938-1999 DVD. Further use of online reading would enter account/SSO/VPN behavior; document delivery remains a separate POST action requiring explicit authorization.",
